From bb772c846255661a3e82045610b65111c7b05204 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dcasati <dcasati@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:44:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] LinuxKPI: add primitives needed by ath12k

Add rhashtable, plus RCU, tasklet and skbuff extensions, and small
additions to the barrier, interrupt, list, pci, pm, slab, socket and
spinlock headers.  These are needed to build ath12k and are otherwise
self-contained.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
